  "thesis": "Procore is the market-leading construction management platform, uniquely positioned to capture complex infrastructure and data center construction (serving 9 of the 10 largest North American data center sites and mega-projects like King Salman International Airport). The thesis seeds emphasize the transformative acquisition of DroneDeploy, bringing 20 trillion square feet of visual reality data, autonomous drone workflows, and AI digital coworkers capable of automated fault detection and site quality verification. However, an independent thesis must evaluate critical vulnerabilities: US commercial and residential construction remains cyclically depressed under higher interest rates, creating headwinds for Gross Volume of Construction (GVC) contract expansions. Additionally, heavy spatial AI data processing carries high infrastructure/inference costs, and enterprise sales cycles in construction remain protracted. PCOR is placed on the evaluation list to monitor DroneDeploy integration, AI coworker monetization, and FCF compounding through the construction cycle.",
